  "body_html": "<p><b>GO WITH VENGEANCE</b></p><p>Heavy cotton. Physique-maximising fits. Imposing presence. Vengeance. For the few.</p><ul>\n<li>Premium soft, heavyweight cotton that you won\u2019t want to take off</li>\n<li>Raw edge hems with a washed design\n</li>\n<li>Unmissable Archangel graphic</li>\n</ul><p><br></p><p><b>SIZE &amp; FIT</b></p><ul>\n<li>Oversized fit</li>\n<li>Model is 5'10\" and wears size M</li>\n</ul><p><br></p><p><b>MATERIALS &amp; CARE</b></p><ul>\n<li>100% Cotton\n</li>\n<li>220gsm, heavyweight fabric</li>\n</ul><p><br></p><p>SKU:\u00a0A5C8L-WD9L</p>",
